    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/17/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251015232050\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"581\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hakufu_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/17/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251015232050\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>南优小征服者</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHakufu_Sonsaku%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>白凤</b>  是一个拥有丰满身材的美少女。她长着一头飘逸的草莓金色长发，垂至背部，遮住耳朵。她的刘海大多集中在额头中央，遮住了大部分额头。两缕哈库芙的头发在头顶竖起。\n\n</p><p><b>白凤</b>  通常穿着她的  <b>南优学院</b>  制服，包括红色格子裙、黄色针织背心，内搭白色带领衬衫、白色袜子和棕色乐福鞋。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHakufu_Sonsaku%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>白凤</b>  通常是个好人，但当她不如意时，会像孩子一样大发雷霆。她也很固执，会不假思索地投入任何情况或战斗，暴露自己于严重危险中。她有时也表现得像个典型的「无脑美女」，显出低智商和完全缺乏常识的时刻——比如对他人真实意图极度天真，或无法看清周围的「大局」。\n\n</p><p><b>白凤</b>  热爱战斗，但她坚决反对杀害对手或对其故意使用暴力。尽管命运注定她要征服所有学校，但哈库芙只想战斗。基本上，她为了战斗而战斗。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:75px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (251 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:75px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/11/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20251015233905\" title=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (251 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (251 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/11/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20251015233905\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Leina_--_Sonsaku_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:90px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Leina_%C3%97_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Leina × Sonsaku Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (298 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:90px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/ec/Leina_%C3%97_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/90?cb=20251015233906\" title=\"Leina × Sonsaku Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (298 KB)\